               Ellery                                                           Maud                
                                                                                                    
┌── Maud ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                                                                                                  │
│   This was nailed to the chapel door. I took it down before anyone-- I took it down, and I       │
│   rang the bell. They'll burn the village at noon unless three people walk up to the             │
│   toll-fort.                                                                                     │
│                                                                                                  │
